  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multi Donor Trust Fund for the Adolescent Girls Initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The developmental objective of the Trust Fund is to promote the  economic empowerment of adolescent girls and young women and to  increase their employability as wage-earners and entrepreneurs in  World Bank client countries, in order to accelerate growth.</narrative>
  </description>
